   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0401_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>ʿL ʾnwšʾḇyȳʾt swhlgwšnsp̄ˈ nc
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>Y̱LYDWNṭ hlṭ-wndʾṭʾwsṭʾbdʾl ŠRM KBD
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>◯ MRʿḤ MN ẔK Y ʿL bwnˈ ẔNH BYRḤ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>ʾṭwrˈ QDM ŠNṬ $X W YWMˈ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>ʾlṭˈ cygwn-m PWN hdybʾlyh plmwṭˈp̄ˈ
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>YḤBWNṭn NKSYʾ S-III ʿL gwšnsp̄ˈp̄ˈ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>Y ʾwšṭlykʾn ʾy YḤBWNyts
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0401_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>A1 ō anōšayād Suxrgušnasp namāz
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>A2 zād xrad-windād ōstāndār A3 drōd was
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>◯ B xwadāy az ān ī ō bun ēn māh
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>Ādur abar sāl 30 ud rōz
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>Ard čiyōn-am pad ayārīh framūd
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>dādan Bx xwāstag satēr 3 ō Gušnasp
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>ī uštarīgān ē dahēd
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="de">
            <ab xml:id="MP0401_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>A1 To Suxrgušnasp with immortal remembrance, reverence!
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>A2 (From) the Ōstāndār, born with inherited wisdom, many greetings.
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>B Sir, from that which (belongs) to the bun, this month
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>Ādur (9th month) in the year 30 and day
               <lb n="5-6" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-6"/>Ard (25th day), as I ordered to give money: Bx 3 staters to Gušnasp
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>of the *camel riders/drivers you should give.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>